{"message":"I found your referral activity. Your Silver Rewards Card referral dated 11/13/2025 is still IN_PROGRESS, meaning the friend opened the account but has not yet met the qualifying criteria. For that card, the friend must spend at least $750 within 60 days of account opening; your $75 bonus typically posts within one to two billing cycles after that requirement is met.

You also have COMPLETE referrals for Bronze Rewards, Gold Rewards, Platinum Rewards, and Silver Rewards Cards. A COMPLETE status means the bonus criteria were met and the bonus should be granted under the applicable card terms.

Which friend or card are you asking about—especially if it is one of the COMPLETE referrals? The referral date will help me pinpoint it."}
